==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Chilling Reign|Steenee|14}} from the {{TCG|Chilling Reign}} expansion.
*'''Leaf Step''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Shining Celebi|79}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

